  "review": [
    "Local/live consume actual opaque DBSession one-shot handoff only; require chosen slot/nonzero owned selection-generation and positive signed32 selected DBID matching original handoff field before Map start. Zero/high/mismatching poisoned handoffs refuse.",
    "Map expected DBID set from handoff.selected_dbid, never from raw generic link_id, slot or cookie. Coordinator selection-generation labels remain its own monotonic lifetime; DBSession handoff generation is separately validated nonzero and belongs to the currently owned DBSession.",
    "Local development remains mutually exclusive with authenticated and loopback endpoint restricted; matching positive expected ID now permitted. Standalone unknown0 remains unknown, and neither authorization POD labels nor nonzero expected ID establish complete entity/character identity.",
    "Selected DBID seeds existing inspector expected identity only; character_identity_verified remains false until required source-qualified transaction. No READY/REQALLENTS/RECEIVED_CHARACTER/full-update applicationACK, renderer or world permit introduced.",
    "Lifecycle phase/cancellation/wipes/disconnect and socket cleanup paths unchanged; local genuine OSUDP scripted DB\u2192Map chain verifies propagation, authenticated owner scenarios use mocks plus actualTCP refusal boundary rather than successful AuthServer\u2192DB\u2192Map session."
  ],
